<Base title="Privacy notice | Storya Consulting" description="How Storya Consulting handles the personal data you send through this website." path="/privacy/">
<div class="pagehead">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy <em>notice.</em></h1>
  </div>

  <div class="legal">
    <p>Last updated: 7 October 2026</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>This notice explains how Storya Consulting handles personal data collected through storyaconsulting.com. Storya Consulting is provided by Akitsu Consulting Pte. Ltd. (UEN 202435379K), which is the organisation responsible for the data described here.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>If you complete the form on the Start page: your answers, your name, work email and company, your role if you give it, and any question you add.</li>
      <li>If you email us: your message and your address.</li>
      <li>From the site itself: nothing. The site sets no cookies and runs no analytics. If that changes, we will update this notice first.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we use it for</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To read your answers and write back to you. You asked us to.</li>
      <li>To use a question you add to the form in an episode of Dumb Questions About AI, without your name or your firm's.</li>
      <li>To see which problems come up most, so we can shape the series and our work. We look at this across everyone who answers, and we don't name you or your firm.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who sees it</h2>
    <p>Paolo Danese and Rafael Soriano. Your answers reach us by email at paolo@storyaconsulting.com, and Paolo shares them with Rafael. Two companies handle data on our behalf: Zoho, which hosts our email, and Cloudflare, which hosts our website. We don't sell your details, and we don't paste your answers into public AI tools.</p>

    <h2>Where it is kept</h2>
    <p>Your answers are kept in the mailbox at paolo@storyaconsulting.com, hosted by Zoho Mail in the United States. Because that is outside Singapore, we rely on Zoho to protect your details to a standard comparable to the one Singapore requires.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>Answers and contact details: 12 months after our last exchange with you, then we delete them.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask to see what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it, at any time. To make a request, write to the contact below. We will reply within 30 days.</p>

    <h2>Contact for data protection</h2>
    <p>Paolo Danese, paolo@storyaconsulting.com</p>

    <h2>If this notice changes</h2>
    <p>We will change the date at the top.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
